OpenClaw Private
================

Plugins for OpenClaw (https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw), Copyright (c)
OpenClaw Foundation, MIT License. This repository started as a fork of
OpenClaw; parts of the plugin structure follow OpenClaw's bundled plugins.
OpenClaw itself is installed separately and is not included here.

Portions of the action gateway, policy engine, control state machine and audit
vocabulary are ported from OpenBot (https://github.com/CopilotKit/OpenBot),
Copyright (c) 2026 CopilotKit, MIT License. Ported files carry a header naming
their origin.

Ideas (not code) for the privacy architecture were taken from Blobbies
(https://github.com/KenKaiii/blobbies, AGPL-3.0). No Blobbies source code is
included.

Third-party runtime dependencies:
- tinfoil (https://github.com/tinfoilsh/tinfoil-js), Apache-2.0
- privatemode-ai (Edgeless Systems GmbH), MIT
- openai (https://github.com/openai/openai-node), Apache-2.0
- cel-js, MIT
- typebox, MIT
